      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Focus-sized documents in the workspace\n\nA graph is a combined document: Views, nodes and relationships render together as authored. Paid workspace focus expands one graph to its document size inside its own boundary; the previous graph contracts and neighboring graphs settle around the changed frames. Free mode has no surrounding workspace: the focused graph is the entire environment. This task supersedes fixed-frame-on-focus behavior, not the protection against repeated-click or zoom-driven reflow.\n\nImplementation is planned, not complete. Eight tasks and three sizing/layout decisions are recorded in this graph."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "focus-sized-workspace"
        }
      }
    },
